e_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s1","report_id":"dev_009","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s2","report_id":"dev_009","text":"The learning rate was set to 0.01 with the Adam optimizer.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s3","report_id":"dev_009","text":"We trained each model for 100 epochs with a batch size of 128.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s4","report_id":"dev_009","text":"Figure 1 shows the f1 score during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s5","report_id":"dev_009","text":"As shown in Figure 1, from epoch 4 to epoch 7, the F1 score of LSTM improves by a relative 13.0%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s6","report_id":"dev_009","text":"At epoch 7, LSTM is 2 points better than BERT-base (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s7","report_id":"dev_009","text":"As shown in Figure 1, GRU reaches 88.2% F1 score at epoch 9.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s8","report_id":"dev_009","text":"As shown in Figure 1, BERT-base attains a F1 score of 89.0% at epoch 7.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s9","report_id":"dev_009","text":"Figure 2 shows the validation accuracy during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s10","report_id":"dev_009","text":"GRU reaches 81.2% validation accuracy at epoch 8.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s11","report_id":"dev_009","text":"At epoch 4, GRU achieves about 80% validation accuracy.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s12","report_id":"dev_009","text":"As shown in Figure 2, GRU scores about 4 points higher on 4 than on 2.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s13","report_id":"dev_009","text":"Figure 3 shows the training loss.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s14","report_id":"dev_009","text":"DistilBERT has a loss of 0.483 at epoch 35.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s15","report_id":"dev_009","text":"LSTM has a loss of -0.222 at epoch 20 (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s16","report_id":"dev_009","text":"DistilBERT has a loss of 0.820 at epoch 15.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s17","report_id":"dev_009","text":"Figure 4 shows the f1 score during training.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s18","report_id":"dev_009","text":"At epoch 10, MobileNet is 47.7 points better than Transformer.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s19","report_id":"dev_009","text":"MobileNet outperforms ResNet-50 by 12.8 percentage points at epoch 16.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s20","report_id":"dev_009","text":"From epoch 8 to epoch 22, the F1 score of DistilBERT improves by a relative 1.0%.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s21","report_id":"dev_009","text":"On IMDB, XGBoost obtains an accuracy of 82.0%.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"dev_009_s22","report_id":"dev_009","text":"We note that the training was stable for all models.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}]}